<worksheet><title>Properties of Sets (1.1b)</title>
<page>

<p> Commutative laws </p>
<ul>
<li> <p><m>A \cup B = B \cup A</m></p></li>
<li> <p><m>A \cap B = B \cap A</m></p></li>
</ul>

<p>Associative Laws</p>
<ul>
<li>
    <p>
        <m>(A \cup B) \cup C = A \cup (B \cup C)</m>
    </p>
</li>
</ul>

